== 1. authorization request (the browser is sent here)
http://127.0.0.1:8080/realms/harbor/protocol/openid-connect/auth
  ?response_type=code
  &client_id=harbor-storefront
  &redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2F127.0.0.1%3A8090%2Fcallback
  &scope=openid+orders%3Aread+orders%3Awrite+delegation%3Aclient%3Aharbor-assistant
  &state=40sdvcAVpmo_Cu7OBSwEfQ
  &nonce=rOKeIvL9cs1qqjcHZAjLVQ
  &code_challenge=nRmPqT0mnXCiVUaBhhwAw2ddWbHU0XkILrHBCsUuG4Y
  &code_challenge_method=S256

== 2. redirect back to the storefront
http://127.0.0.1:8090/callback?state=40sdvcAVpmo_Cu7OBSwEfQ&session_state=7QChW4-tjAZnOjMkw9agIFXc&iss=http://127.0.0.1:8080/realms/harbor&code=<98 chars>

== 3. a token request with the wrong code verifier
POST /realms/harbor/protocol/openid-connect/token HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8080
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&
code=<98 chars>&
redirect_uri=http://127.0.0.1:8090/callback&
client_id=harbor-storefront&
code_verifier=<43 chars>

HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
cache-control: no-store
content-type: application/json

{
  "error": "invalid_grant",
  "error_description": "PKCE verification failed: Code mismatch"
}

== 4. the token request with the right verifier
POST /realms/harbor/protocol/openid-connect/token HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8080
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&
code=<98 chars>&
redirect_uri=http://127.0.0.1:8090/callback&
client_id=harbor-storefront&
code_verifier=<43 chars>

HTTP/1.1 200 OK
cache-control: no-store
content-type: application/json

{
  "access_token": "<JWT 1275 chars>",
  "expires_in": 300,
  "refresh_expires_in": 1800,
  "refresh_token": "<JWT 856 chars>",
  "token_type": "Bearer",
  "id_token": "<JWT 1173 chars>",
  "not-before-policy": 0,
  "session_state": "WrLyx6dDhbM0BPFXas4wpXqf",
  "scope": "openid orders:read orders:write delegation:client:harbor-assistant profile"
}
